OL,3,GNEWSAThousands without power and some
OL,4,Aflights cancelled as Storm Austen
OL,5,Alashes south-west England
OL,6,
OL,7,FPower cuts are affecting nearly 7,000
OL,8,Fhomes in Cornwall and Devon as Storm
OL,9,FAusten hits parts of the UK
OL,11,FLoganair confirms 18 flights have been
OL,12,Fcancelled today, including services
OL,13,Ffrom Jersey and to Cornwall Newquay -
OL,14,Fhere's a quick look at some of the
OL,15,Ftravel disruption we've seen so far
OL,17,FGreat Western Railway (GWR) says speed
OL,18,Flimits will be in place on routes
OL,19,Fbetween Devon and Cornwall until 13:00
OL,20,FBST. Network Rail Scotland also says
OL,21,Ftrains will be slowed down in areas
OL,22,Fwhere the heaviest rain is forecast
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
