OL,3,GNEWSAThousands without power and some
OL,4,Aflights cancelled as Storm Austen
OL,5,Alashes south-west England
OL,6,
OL,7,FA red warning is in place for Guernsey
OL,8,Fand Jersey; Cornwall and parts of Devon
OL,9,Fare under an amber weather warning for
OL,10,Fstrong winds. A yellow rain warning is
OL,11,Fin place in parts of Scotland,
OL,12,Fincluding the Lothian Borders
OL,14,FA further yellow weather warning for
OL,15,Fwind is kicking in from 10:00 for
OL,16,Fmillions across the South East and
OL,17,FNorth West of England, the East
OL,18,FMidlands and Wales
